#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the IBM Quantum Compute client so you can run jobs with IBM Quantum Compute Service."
msgstr "ثبِّت عميل IBM Quantum Compute حتى تتمكن من تشغيل المهام مع خدمة IBM Quantum Compute."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the IBM Quantum Compute client"
msgstr "تثبيت عميل IBM Quantum Compute"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore manylinux miniconda */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore manylinux miniconda */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the IBM Quantum Compute client {#install-the-ibm-quantum-compute-client}"
msgstr "تثبيت عميل IBM Quantum Compute {#install-the-ibm-quantum-compute-client}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum Compute Service is the cloud-based service for executing quantum computations on IBM Quantum&reg; hardware. This guide shows you how to install `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, which is the client package for accessing IBM Quantum Compute Service.\n"
msgstr "خدمة IBM Quantum Compute هي الخدمة السحابية لتنفيذ الحسابات الكمية على أجهزة IBM Quantum&reg;. يوضح هذا الدليل كيفية تثبيت `qiskit-ibm-runtime`، وهي حزمة العميل للوصول إلى خدمة IBM Quantum Compute.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before installing the `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, follow the instructions in these guides:\n"
msgstr "قبل تثبيت `qiskit-ibm-runtime`، اتبع التعليمات الواردة في هذه الأدلة:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Install Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit). \n"
msgstr "[تثبيت Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Set up your IBM Cloud account](cloud-setup).\n"
msgstr "[إعداد حساب IBM Cloud الخاص بك](cloud-setup).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run this command to install the IBM Quantum Compute client:\n"
msgstr "شغِّل هذا الأمر لتثبيت عميل IBM Quantum Compute:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Stay current with the latest versions\">\n"
"Periodically check the [`qiskit-ibm-runtime` release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/release-notes) to see new releases. We recommend frequently updating your requirements for `qiskit-ibm-runtime` by running `pip install -U qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"ابقَ على اطلاع بأحدث الإصدارات\">\n"
"تفقَّد دوريًا [ملاحظات إصدار `qiskit-ibm-runtime`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/release-notes) للاطلاع على الإصدارات الجديدة. نوصي بتحديث متطلباتك لـ `qiskit-ibm-runtime` بشكل متكرر عبر تشغيل `pip install -U qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "الخطوات التالية {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - [Install the Qiskit SDK from source](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Run your first program](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Try a tutorial, such as [Grover's algorithm](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"  - Review the [deprecation policy](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/DEPRECATION.md).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"توصيات\">\n"
"  - [تثبيت Qiskit SDK من المصدر](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [شغِّل برنامجك الأول](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - جرِّب درسًا تعليميًا، مثل [خوارزمية Grover](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"  - راجع [سياسة الإهمال](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/DEPRECATION.md).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
